8 0 obj
<< /Length 2609 >>
stream
BT /F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 780.0 Tm (   Summary: Comparing two or more things.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 764.0 Tm (   Example: This road is narrower than that one.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 748.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 732.0 Tm (24. As as) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 716.0 Tm (   Summary: Equality with an adjective or adverb between.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 700.0 Tm (   Example: He runs as fast as his sister.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 684.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668.0 Tm (25. Too and Enough) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 652.0 Tm (   Summary: Too before an adjective means more than needed.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 636.0 Tm (   Example: The coffee is too hot to drink.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 620.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 604.0 Tm (26. So and Such) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 588.0 Tm (   Summary: So before an adjective, such before a noun phrase.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 572.0 Tm (   Example: It was such a nice day.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 556.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 540.0 Tm (27. Although and Though) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 524.0 Tm (   Summary: A contrast that can start or end a clause.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 508.0 Tm (   Example: Although it rained, we went out.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 492.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 476.0 Tm (28. Despite and In spite of) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 460.0 Tm (   Summary: A contrast followed by a noun or -ing.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 444.0 Tm (   Example: Despite the rain, we went out.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 428.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 412.0 Tm (29. Because and Because of) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 396.0 Tm (   Summary: Because takes a clause, because of a noun.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 380.0 Tm (   Example: We stayed because of the storm.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 364.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 348.0 Tm (30. Linking Words of Addition) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 332.0 Tm (   Summary: Moreover, furthermore and in addition add points.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 316.0 Tm (   Example: Moreover, the price is fair.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 300.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 284.0 Tm (31. Linking Words of Contrast) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 268.0 Tm (   Summary: However and nevertheless show a turn.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 252.0 Tm (   Example: However, the plan has risks.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 236.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 220.0 Tm (32. Linking Words of Cause) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 204.0 Tm (   Summary: Therefore and consequently give a result.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 188.0 Tm (   Example: It rained; therefore we stayed home.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 172.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 156.0 Tm (33. Linking Words of Result) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 140.0 Tm (   Summary: So and as a result close the chain.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 124.0 Tm (   Example: It rained, so we stayed home.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 108.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 92.0 Tm (34. Articles a an the) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 76.0 Tm (   Summary: A/an for one of many, the for a known one.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 60.0 Tm (   Example: I saw a cat. The cat was black.) Tj
ET
endstream
