10 0 obj
<< /Length 2508 >>
stream
BT /F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 780.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 764.0 Tm (35. Countable and Uncountable) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 748.0 Tm (   Summary: Some nouns have no plural and take different quantifiers.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 732.0 Tm (   Example: We need more information.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 716.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 700.0 Tm (36. Subject Verb Agreement) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 684.0 Tm (   Summary: The verb agrees with the subject, not the nearest noun.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668.0 Tm (   Example: The list of items is long.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 652.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 636.0 Tm (37. Tag Questions) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 620.0 Tm (   Summary: A short question tag checks or confirms.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 604.0 Tm (   Example: It's cold today, isn't it?) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 588.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 572.0 Tm (38. Prepositions of Place) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 556.0 Tm (   Summary: In, on and at for position.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 540.0 Tm (   Example: The book is on the table.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 524.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 508.0 Tm (39. Prepositions of Time) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 492.0 Tm (   Summary: In, on and at for time expressions.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 476.0 Tm (   Example: We meet at noon on Monday.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 460.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 444.0 Tm (40. Phrasal Verbs with Look) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 428.0 Tm (   Summary: Look after, look for and look forward to.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 412.0 Tm (   Example: Please look after the house.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 396.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 380.0 Tm (41. Phrasal Verbs with Get) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 364.0 Tm (   Summary: Get up, get over and get along.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 348.0 Tm (   Example: I get up early on Mondays.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 332.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 316.0 Tm (42. Active to Passive Conversion) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 300.0 Tm (   Summary: Only transitive verbs can be passivized.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 284.0 Tm (   Example: Someone stole my bike. / My bike was stolen.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 268.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 252.0 Tm (43. Question Formation) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 236.0 Tm (   Summary: Auxiliaries move before the subject in questions.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 220.0 Tm (   Example: Where did you go?) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 204.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 188.0 Tm (44. Negation with Never) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 172.0 Tm (   Summary: Never sits before the main verb.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 156.0 Tm (   Example: I never eat fast food.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 140.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 124.0 Tm (45. Causative Have and Get) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 108.0 Tm (   Summary: Have something done means someone else does it.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 92.0 Tm (   Example: I had my hair cut.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 76.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 60.0 Tm (46. Reported Requests) Tj
ET
endstream
