stream
BT /F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 780.0 Tm (   Summary: Told me to for a request in speech.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 764.0 Tm (   Example: She told me to wait.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 748.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 732.0 Tm (47. Purpose Clauses) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 716.0 Tm (   Summary: To and so that express purpose.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 700.0 Tm (   Example: I study to learn English.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 684.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 668.0 Tm (48. Time Clauses) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 652.0 Tm (   Summary: When, while and before take present for future.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 636.0 Tm (   Example: When he comes, we will start.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 620.0 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 604.0 Tm (End of the grammar handout.) Tj
ET
endstream
